#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Unapp is a lightweight, block-based WordPress theme with thirteen one-click starter sites — SaaS, portfolio, church, blog, fitness, restaurant, agency, shop, property, practice, courses, events and finance. Built for the Site Editor with 140+ section patterns, ten colour palettes and five typography presets you can mix, seven section styles and eleven block styles. WooCommerce templates included. Self-hosted variable fonts, no page-builder framework, no jQuery, no icon fonts."
msgstr ""

